# A version published less than 3 days ago is not installed: most malicious releases are pulled
# from the registry within hours. Locked versions are not re-checked, so `npm ci` is unaffected.
# renovate.json5 carries the same number for what Renovate proposes; ReleaseAgeParityTest fails
# when the two disagree. Renovate itself does not read this file. See docs/dependency-updates.md.
# scripts/update-frankenphp.sh reads the number below for the FrankenPHP binary: it holds no copy.
min-release-age=3
